{"id": "62252", "title": "After　Love", "author": "JT S", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62252.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／校园故事／一般言情／悲剧\r\n\r\n关键字：主角 　配角 　其他\r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n爱了以後，会发生什麽事情？\r\n\r\n在手机ＡＰＰ上面，她传了这样的讯息：\r\n\r\n『他陪我从这栋医院的顶楼跳下去，你问我跟他是什麽关系？』\r\n\r\n一旁传来抱怨的声音：\r\n\r\n“喂！你这样讲，别人根本不会相信我们那时候不认识！”", "base": "files/article/html/62/62252", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9228122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9228124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9228126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9228129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9228131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9228133.html", "available": false}]}